s="text-[12.5px] leading-snug" style="color:var(--arbor-ink)">Sit beside the bed for the first two minutes, then step to the doorway.</span></button></li></ul></div><div class="rounded-xl p-3.5 bg-white" style="border:1px solid var(--arbor-rule)"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider" style="color:var(--arbor-sky-ink)"><span class="msr" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:12px;font-variation-settings:&#x27;opsz&#x27; 12, &#x27;wght&#x27; 500, &#x27;GRAD&#x27; 0, &#x27;FILL&#x27; 0;flex-shrink:0">group</span> המועצה התייעצה · 1 קולות</span></div><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="text-[12.5px] leading-snug"><span class="font-bold" style="color:var(--arbor-ink)">Bowlby</span><span class="text-[10px] font-bold" style="color:var(--arbor-muted)"> · Secure base</span><span class="block mt-0.5" style="color:var(--arbor-muted)">The check-in IS the secure base.</span><span class="block mt-0.5" style="color:var(--arbor-ink)">→ Keep the interval predictable.</span></li></ul></div><div class="rounded-xl" style="border:1px solid var(--arbor-rule);overflow:hidden"><button aria-expanded="false" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-2 px-3.5 py-2.5 min-h-[44px] transition" style="background:var(--arbor-paper-deep)"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider" style="color:var(--arbor-muted)"><span class="msr" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:12px;font-variation-settings:&#x27;opsz&#x27; 12, &#x27;wght&#x27; 500, &#x27;GRAD&#x27; 0, &#x27;FILL&#x27; 0;flex-shrink:0">lightbulb</span> למה זה אולי קורה</span><span class="text-[10px] font-bold inline-flex items-center gap-0.5" style="color:var(--arbor-muted)"><span class="msr" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:14px;font-variation-settings:&#x27;opsz&#x27; 14, &#x27;wght&#x27; 500, &#x27;GRAD&#x27; 0, &#x27;FILL&#x27; 0;flex-shrink:0">expand_more</span