-variation-settings:&#x27;opsz&#x27; 13, &#x27;wght&#x27; 500, &#x27;GRAD&#x27; 0, &#x27;FILL&#x27; 0;flex-shrink:0">psychology</span>Grounded in 2 facts you approved<span aria-hidden="true">·</span><button type="button" class="font-extrabold underline-offset-2 hover:underline focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-1 rounded" style="color:var(--arbor-green-ink)">Manage</button></span><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 min-h-[32px] rounded-full transition focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-1" style="background:var(--arbor-green-soft);color:var(--arbor-green-ink)"><span class="msr" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:13px;font-variation-settings:&#x27;opsz&#x27; 13, &#x27;wght&#x27; 500, &#x27;GRAD&#x27; 0, &#x27;FILL&#x27; 0;flex-shrink:0">lightbulb</span> Arbor suggests remembering something — review</button></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-1"><button class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg transition" style="background:var(--arbor-green-soft);color:var(--arbor-green-ink)"><span class="msr" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:14px;font-variation-settings:&#x27;opsz&#x27; 14, &#x27;wght&#x27; 500, &#x27;GRAD&#x27; 0, &#x27;FILL&#x27; 0;flex-shrink:0">playlist_add</span> Save to plan</button><button class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg transition bg-white" style="color:var(--arbor-muted);border:1px solid var(--arbor-rule)"><span class="msr" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:14px;font-variation-settings:&#x27;opsz&#x27; 14, &#x27;wght&#x27; 500, &#x27;GRAD&#x27; 0, &#x27;FILL&#x27; 0;flex-shrink:0">send</span> Teacher note</button></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 pt-1"><span class="text-[11px] font-bold" style="color:var(--arbor-muted)">Did this answer help?</span><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="It helped" title="It helped" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-bold px-2 py-1 min-h-[32px] rounded-full transition focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-1" style="background:white;color:var(--arbor-muted);border:1px solid var(--arbor-rule)"><span class="msr" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:13px;font-variation-settings:&#x27;opsz&#x27; 13, &#x27;wght&#x27; 500, &#x27;GRAD&#x27; 0, &#x27;FILL&#x27; 0;flex-shrink:0">thumb_up</span> It helped</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="It didn&#x27;t help" title="It didn&#x27;t help" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-bold px-2 py-1 min-h-[32px] rounded-full transition focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-1" style="background:white;color:var(--arbor-muted);border:1px solid var(--arbor-rule)"><span class="msr" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:13px;font-variation-settings:&#x27;opsz&#x27; 13, &#x27;wght&#x27; 500, &#x27;GRAD&#x27; 0, &#x27;FILL&#x27; 0;flex-shrink:0">thumb_down</span> It didn&#x27;t help</button><span class="text-[10px] w-full" style="color:var(--arbor-muted)">This is about the answer, never about your child.</span></div></div>"`;
